  "boundary": "Digest/name/read-only-root/bind-mount admission, confirmed stop, private native log retention, file and directory synchronization, then container removal without force or volumes. Native snapshot recovery hashes all stopped-target private files before/after removal. Fault controls preserve private files and make identity, stop, log, file/directory sync and removal failures visible.",
